                             implementation inside                              
                             count_subsequence_pairs is too                     
                             complicated and would TLE or be wrong              
                             for the constraints, especially since              
                             the test expects a DP or combinatorial             
                             formula for counting subsets with gcd              
                             exactly g. But the constraints are                 
                             small (n=200, a_i<=200), so we can use             
                             the following efficient standard                   
                             method:\\n\\nThe standard trick is:                
                             \\n\\nFor a multiset of numbers, the               
                             number of non-empty subsets whose gcd              
